sequenceDiagram
participant C as SessionController
participant N as SignalClient
participant T as QTcpSocket
participant S as SignalServer
C->>N: request(type, fields)
N->>N: 分配字符串 id，检查帧和写队列上限
N->>T: write 四字节大端长度及 JSON
N-->>C: id
T->>S: TCP 字节流
S-->>T: 分片或粘包响应及事件
T-->>N: readyRead
N->>N: 缓存半帧，逐帧取出完整 JSON
alt 帧长、JSON、编号或类型错误
N->>T: abort
N-->>C: stateChanged disconnected
else 完整合法帧
N->>N: 按 id 取消请求超时定时器
N-->>C: response 或 eventReceived
end
Note over N,T: 帧最大 64 KiB，未完成请求最多 32，写队列最大 256 KiB
